android
# NOTE: do NOT list the build output here. vercel.json sets
# outputDirectory: dist, and Vercel applies .vercelignore when collecting that
# directory - ignoring it made the deploy fail with
#   ENOENT: no such file or directory, open '/vercel/path0/dist/offline.html'
# dist/ and public/ are already in .gitignore, so they are never uploaded as
# source regardless; the entry was redundant as well as harmful.
